flowchart LR
    CL["Client apps<br/>raise requests, poll status,<br/>download reports"]
    OPS["Operations<br/>upload the finished report;<br/>the ops-only cancellation path"]
    A0["Auth0<br/>issues and validates the JWT;<br/>the app is a resource server,<br/>never holds credentials"]
    EXT["Auditor-management context<br/>out of scope here; emits capacity<br/>events (onboarded, availability opened)"]

    subgraph APP["Audit scheduling application - one deployment"]
        API["HTTP API<br/>client + internal endpoints;<br/>validates, maps errors,<br/>projects a request across both tables"]
        WK["Assignment worker<br/>single writer; drains the PENDING<br/>queue, picks auditor + date,<br/>attaches or schedules"]
        RLY["Outbox relay<br/>the only reader of the outbox;<br/>publishes every row to the broker"]
        NM["Notification consumer<br/>broker subscriber; one email per<br/>request event, deduped by event id"]
    end

    PG[("PostgreSQL<br/>audit_request + audit (written)<br/>supplier / site catalogue (insert-only)<br/>client / auditor (read-only)<br/>outbox_event, notification_dispatch")]
    BRK{{"Message broker<br/>fan-out transport;<br/>at-least-once, never durability"}}
    TRAIL["Audit-trail service<br/>external; own database, retention<br/>and access control. The immutable<br/>record, not deletable by this system"]
    MAIL["Email provider<br/>the NotificationSender channel;<br/>templating and delivery out of scope"]

    CL -->|HTTPS + JWT| API
    OPS -->|HTTPS + JWT| API
    API -.->|validate JWT| A0
    API -->|state change + outbox row, one transaction| PG
    WK -->|claim with SKIP LOCKED, write audit + outbox| PG
    RLY -->|poll unpublished rows| PG
    NM -->|notification_dispatch| PG
    RLY -->|publish| BRK
    BRK -->|every event| TRAIL
    BRK -->|AuditRequest events| NM
    NM -->|send| MAIL
    EXT -->|capacity events| BRK
    BRK -->|capacity events, retry pending| WK
    PG -.->|LISTEN / NOTIFY, wake the worker| WK
